        "original_id": "8935a726-47d2-53d6-b81a-231462a79554",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: James Dean\n- Films: East of Eden, Giant\n- Roles: Cal Trask, Jett Rink\n- Awards: Academy Award nominations\n- Events: James Dean's death, Giant's release\n\nFacts:\n- In 1955, James Dean played the loner Cal Trask in the film \"East of Eden,\" and this role helped define his stardom.\n- James Dean played the surly ranch hand Jett Rink in \"Giant,\" a role that also helped define his stardom.\n- \"Giant\" was James Dean's third and final film as a leading actor.\n- James Dean was killed in a car accident before \"Giant\" was released.\n- James Dean received his second and final Academy Award nomination for \"Giant.\"",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
